icant deviations from the Chromium, such as branding, configuration formats, file locations, and other interface changes.\nungoogled-chromium will not modify the Chromium browser outside of the project's goals.\nSince these goals and requirements are not precise, unclear situations are discussed and decided on a case-by-case basis.","moniker":"ungoogled-chromium","name":"Chromium","packageUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows/releases","publisher":"The Chromium Authors","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","tags":["browser","chromium","ungoogled"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/ungoogled-software/ungoogled-chromium-windows","releaseDate":"2022-08-04","releaseDateSource":"manifest","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.9.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/114.0.5735.199/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.yaml","sha256":"b817584f717d9308067abe619209606139b8a673d9cbcacf35ed1c9ca5d0d2ea"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/114.0.5735.199/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.installer.yaml","sha256":"a4bfae9ea9632951085693dd3e37fdb9e3dbdd52275515770de4083cf981cecb"},{"path":"manifests/e/eloston/ungoogled-chromium/114.0.5735.199/eloston.ungoogled-chromium.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"421b559ecc39044a0f9ec51fb8363febdcf08480b5854ff610ea1516930a655e"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"114.0.5735.199"}